RVDU id [ROLL | REPLAY] | SERVER url | NEW [title] | LIST |
     PUT id key text | TEST id key [n]
  A remote VDU console: screens on a VDU server (tools/vdu: vdu.php,
  any PHP web server) - extra displays any program writes to with
  HTTP GETs, any number of viewers watching (browsers, a 3DS, CPCs).
  NET M4 first.
    RVDU SERVER url   the server: vdu.php's address (RVDU.CFG)
    RVDU id           the screen, live: its text where it is put (the
                      CPC's console: no colours or graphics); a key
                      goes back to its writer (KEY n); ESC quits
    RVDU id ROLL      a rolling log: each PRINT a line at the bottom
    RVDU id REPLAY    from its start, then live
    RVDU NEW [title]  a new screen: its id and key (the key writes)
    RVDU LIST         the public screens
    RVDU PUT id key text   a command to it (PRINT Hello, LOCATE 5 5)
    RVDU TEST id key [n]   the CPC writes a test: a count in place,
                      touch zones - the taps in a browser come back
                      and are shown here (QUIT, ESC or n seconds end it)
  A screen's commands: MODE CLS PRINT LOCATE PEN PAPER INK BORDER
  WINDOW STREAM TITLE, graphics, ZONE (tools/vdu/README.md)
